#📊📊 📊 Production Dashboard using Power BI

##🛩️🛩️ 🚀 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing production data using Power BI.
The dashboard provides clear insights into production trends, performance, and distribution across different categories.

---

## 🎯🎯🎯 Objectives

* Analyze total production performance
* Identify trends over time
* Compare production across categories
* Provide interactive insights using visuals

---

##🎯🎯📁📁 📂 Dataset

* File Name: `production_data.csv`
* Contains:

  * Date
  * Production Values
  * Category / Plant / Region

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used

* Power BI Desktop
* Power Query (Data Cleaning)
* DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)

---

## 📈 Dashboard Features

### 🔹 KPI Cards

* Total Production
* Average Production
* Maximum Production

### 🔹 Visualizations

* 📈 Line Chart → Production trend over time
* 📊 Bar Chart → Category comparison
* 🥧 Pie Chart → Contribution distribution

### 🔹 Filters

* Date slicer
* Category slicer

---

## 🧠 DAX Measures Used

```DAX
Total Production = SUM(production_data[Production])
Average Production = AVERAGE(production_data[Production])
Max Production = MAX(production_data[Production])
```

---

